+ * UIP bit7 computed), 0x0B (stored; UIE bit4 moves the
+ * update-ended IRQ8, SET bit7 freezes updates), 0x0C (flags,
+ * cleared on read), 0x0D (0x80), 0x32 (century, computed).
+ * Everything else is battery-backed RAM.
